\begin{example}[Eikonal equation]
\label{ex:eikonal-complete-integral}
\uses{def:complete-integral}
\dcref{ch3:3.1-ex-2}
\group{Nonlinear First-Order PDE}

For $|Du|=1$, a complete integral is
\[
u(x,a,b)=a\cdot x+b,qquad a\in S^{n-1},\ b\in\R.
\]
\end{example}

